{"thread":{"threadID":3949,"boardID":117,"topic":"Team News - 01.12.2016","time":1480549974,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1480803512,"lastPoster":"Pixel","replies":8,"views":874,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":6},"tags":[{"tagID":9,"name":"admin"},{"tagID":207,"name":"csgo"},{"tagID":985,"name":"doo"},{"tagID":47,"name":"team"}],"posts":[{"postID":53303,"threadID":3949,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Team News - 01.12.2016","time":1480549974,"lastEditTime":1480550319,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":6,"editorID":1825,"editor":"Nachtfrische","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1480590290,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1480592233,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1480602806,"value":1},{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1480609428,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1480610633,"value":1},{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1480725673,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Doo Doo has left the team</strong><br>Unfortunately, <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2147-doo-doo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Doo Doo</a> has decided to leave the entire community.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>He is not going to switch communities or anything in that direction. The leave is entirely because of personal reasons, which I can not disclose here.<br>Doo Doo was a great admin, extremely active, always very kind and entertaining and just a good friend overall.<br>It is sad that he has decided to end his time here.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>We&#x27;ll miss you. Should you ever decide to come back, just message me anywhere <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thank you for your services and commitment for Dream.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53304,"t