r everything and you where a awesome admin and prob will always be a awesome guy, best of luck whatever you do next! <span class=\"missing-media\">[bb*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53335,"threadID":3949,"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","subject":"","time":1480598033,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1480603350,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1480608766,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>I&#x27;m sorry for the loss, my thoughts and prayers are with his family<br>My condolences</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53560,"threadID":3949,"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","subject":"","time":1480723373,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1480724841,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey Andrew,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>big Thanks to you for everything you done<br>for me the players and for the Community.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>You are a very kind guy who knows what fun is.<br>If i had a wish, i would say to you once more<br>what for a nice guy you are.<br>Fucking miss you and the Rocket League time.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Cya big boy <span class=\"missing-media\">[;(]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53687,"threadID":3949,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","subject":"","time":1480803512,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[bb*]</span></p>","polls":[]}]}